{
  "about": "Where each claim on the public site is proved. Every catalogue key whose text (in either language) holds a number must be listed; other claims may be. Each source cites a repository path, optionally with :line, and for a line also a short phrase quoted from that line (says). The phrase is the proof (site/sources.go): it must be on the cited line or exactly once elsewhere in the file (the line moved; `go run ./site -fix-sources` rewrites the number); a phrase the file no longer has, or one that occurs several times but not on the cited line, fails site.TestEveryNumberHasASource. A phrase has at least 12 characters and a letter. Change the text and its source together.",
